/// A client of an API outside the app (an affiliate program, a messaging
/// bot, a payment provider), used by name: blueprint integration shopee.
/// Generated in internal/integrations/<name>: retries with backoff that
/// respect Retry-After, a rate limit, a timeout, secrets from the
/// environment kept out of errors and logs, and, with observability, a span
/// and the client's metrics for each call. Yours, in <name>.go, written
/// once: how a request is authenticated and the API's calls. Every module
/// gets the client in its Deps; <name>test serves a fake API for tests, and
/// <app> <name> check calls the real one with an environment's secrets.
blueprint integration {
  version "0.1.0"
  instances
  requires app, domain, env
  optional worker, observability

  /// The API's address: https://open-api.affiliate.shopee.com.br. The
  /// <NAME>_URL variable changes it per environment.
  option url string
  /// How many requests at most, in this process: 2/s, 120/min, 1000/h; 0,
  /// none.
  option rate_limit string default("0")
  /// How many more times a call is tried when the API fails for a moment
  /// (429, 502, 503, 504, a connection lost), waiting longer each time.
  option retries int default(3)
  /// How long a call may take, its tries included: 30s, 1m.
  option timeout string default("30s")
  /// The API takes a key (an app id, a bot's token): <NAME>_KEY.
  option key bool default(false)
  /// The API takes a secret (to sign requests with): <NAME>_SECRET.
  option secret bool default(false)

  /// Check the API (the client's Check) when the worker starts and every
  /// hour after: a failure is logged and, with observability, recorded as
  /// integration.check 0, which the platform's alerts watch. Off by default:
  /// Check asks GET /, which means nothing to most APIs until you write
  /// it, and some count every call.
  option check bool default(false)
  /// The API's address; the url option by default.
  env INSTANCE_URL string default("{{.Options.url}}")
  /// The API's key.
  env INSTANCE_KEY string secret required when("{{if .Options.key}}true{{end}}")
  /// The API's secret.
  env INSTANCE_SECRET string secret required when("{{if .Options.secret}}true{{end}}")
}
